-.B EBADF
-The 
-.IR "aiocbp->aio_fildes"
-descriptor is not valid.
-.TP
-.B ECANCELED
-The operation was canceled before the operation was finished.
-.TP
-.B EINVAL
-The 
-.IR "aiocbp->aio_offset"
-value is invalid.
-.PP
